Evaluation budget21 stopped true; completed calls 21; row cap11 stopped true; completed calls 21.
Empty callback rejected true; zero modulus rejected true.
Fixed point42: mu 0; lambda 1; calls 4; pairs 3.
Full-width polynomial: state 18446744073709551615; constant 18446744073709551615; modulus 18446744073709551557; residue 3422.
